 "remarks": "Bright and spacious 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartment with an additional versatile room that can be used as a home office, den, or second bedroom. This fully renovated unit features hardwood floors throughout, high ceilings, abundant natural light, and a modern kitchen with brand-new stainless steel appliances.  Additional highlights include one parking space included and access to a washer and dryer in the basement.  Ideally located in the heart of downtown Stamford, just steps away from restaurants, shops, entertainment, and everything the city has to offer. Enjoy the convenience of downtown living in a beautifully updated space!",
